Arrays through relays (benchmarks/gpu-pairs/gpupairs.m) on two GPUs, the
relays sending directly to those of the other GPU (MERK_GPU_PEER=1), on
1 MiB a measurement: every array comes back with its size and last element,
in all 5 chains.
REQUIRES: two-gpus

RUN: merkc -O2 -fprocess-declarations --offload-arch=%offload-arch %libomp-flags %S/../../benchmarks/gpu-pairs/gpupairs.m -o %t
RUN: %gpu-env MERK_GPU_PEER=1 timeout -k 1 300 %t 1 | awk '{ n++; if ($5 != $7) w++ } END { print n " rows, " w + 0 " wrong" }' | FileCheck %s --match-full-lines
CHECK: 90 rows, 0 wrong
